WEBVTT

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.920
You practice hard every day.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.310
Gintaro-sama, did I wake you up?

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.070
Don't worry about it.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.550
Where's the stupid kid?

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.940
She's still asleep.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.700
Satoru-kun, breakfast is ready!

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.010
O-Okay.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.300
You already finished cleaning?

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.830
Makoto slept in again?

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.070
Sorry about that.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:52.440
It's okay. I happened to 
wake up early this morning.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.780
Plus, it's only right for me to help out 
when you're letting me stay here.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.840
That's not right, though.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.030
I did all the cleaning back home.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:02.270
Perhaps, but you have kendo 
practice and studying to do,

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.280
so you're probably up late.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.080
Are you getting enough sleep?

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:10.000
I've always been a light 
sleeper, so it's okay.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.460
I'm very impressed, though.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.900
You practice at school and 
train at home every day.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.790
Makoto told me that you're 
going to be a starter.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:21.120
Oh, I don't know yet.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.600
I don't know much about 
kendo, but I hope

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.480
you're chosen as a starter.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.390
Yes...

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.530
I'll be sure to go cheer for you.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:43.290
Oh, we need to start preparing for 
the summer purification ceremony.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.850
Oh, I can skip practice for that.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:49.850
Wait, that won't be necessary.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.530
You have a chance to become a starter.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.920
Makoto and I should be able 
to manage on our own again.

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.690
I've never participated in a 
purification ceremony before.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:02.550
It's possible that I'll 
only get in your way.

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:04.140
I see.

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:07.580
Then maybe I'll ask you to help.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.480
You can bring your friends.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.530
Makoto's planning on 
inviting her friends.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.730
<i>Friends...</i>

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:47.520
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:07.890
<b>It Really Doesn't Matter</b>

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.290
<i>I guess I'm too early...</i>

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.110
<i>The door's unlocked?</i>

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.370
<i>Is someone else here?</i>

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.450
<i>It's the captain...</i>

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.490
<i>That sucks.</i>

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.430
'Sup!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.580
Mornin'!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.590
I suppose that I'll have to let you go.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.090
I'm sorry.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:19.920
Well, I know you're in 
a unique situation.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.540
Everyone should practice on their own.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.860
I'll be back later.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:25.690
Yes!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.160
You're good, but that doesn't

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.680
mean you get to skip 
practice all the time.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.620
It sounds like you have family issues,

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:39.440
but the rest of us get shafted 
when you get special treatment.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.170
Then I'll quit.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.260
Is that what you want?

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:45.400
What? You mad now?

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:51.120
It's not like you guys will 
get to be starters if I quit.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:53.450
Bastard!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.040
Okay, okay. That's enough.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.710
Captain!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.250
Seriously.

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:01.360
If you're gonna fight, 
put your helmets on.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.170
Come on.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.260
U-Uh, well...

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:04.210
This isn't...

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.710
What's wrong?

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.070
Cowards.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.040
Okay, Kamio.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.140
Up for a bout?

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.460
<i>Damn, he's too big.</i>

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.280
<i>That's not important, right?</i>

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.250
<i>He's definitely good.</i>

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.540
That was tough.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.710
You're really good.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.200
<i>Liar. He was wailing 
on me the whole time.</i>

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:52.080
I always have trouble with 
people smaller than me.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.840
<i>Does he have to mention my size?</i>

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.720
<i>It's not like I enjoy fighting 
people bigger than me.</i>

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.080
Hey, Prince.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.190
Huh? What's that about?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.260
What? Isn't that what they call you?

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.650
Who calls me that?

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.110
They do.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.650
It's the Prince!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.710
Wow, he's so small!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.360
Oh, he's with Kinu-chan!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.070
It's even more noticeable when 
he stand next to Kinu-chan!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.140
Kinu-chan!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.180
Prince doesn't seem like the 
best nickname they could use,

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:16.260
since you're a kendo star.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.540
They were calling you Kinu-chan.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.540
That's an odd nickname 
for someone so big.

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.250
Isn't it cute?

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.540
<i>This guy is hard to deal with.</i>

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.030
My family owns a tofu shop.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.360
My last name is Kinugawa, 
which is somehow fitting.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.360
[Kinugoshi Tofu = silken tofu]

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.220
Oh, I see.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:40.140
I left my glove exposed, 
but you kept aiming for my face.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.680
N-Not really...

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:42.600
I like it!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.350
You don't like to lose, huh?

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.780
Hey! Stop it!

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.970
Your bangs are too long,

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:49.230
and your face is a little pale.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:50.460
Are you getting enough to eat?

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.570
I am right now!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.720
What's your problem?!

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:56.810
Checking for blisters.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:57.740
It's not necessary!

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:02.170
I came early today because 
I didn't need to help out

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.710
at home as much.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:07.000
Are you always here so early?

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.880
Did you think I didn't notice you?

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.820
I also finished helping out at 
home a little early. That's all.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.850
Right, you're living 
at a shrine right now?

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.560
Sorry, I heard from the coach.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.710
It's part of being captain.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.440
You miss practice because 
you're helping out?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.320
I'm done with kendo.

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.800
I'm not particularly interested 
in becoming a starter.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.640
If the other members are 
unhappy, I'll quit.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.910
It's not like I have to be in 
a club to practice kendo...

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.880
You need to fix that attitude of yours.

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.380
It doesn't help when 
you're good at it, too.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.290
I know!

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.630
Prince, are you free after practice?

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.360
I'm not.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.840
And stop calling me Prince.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.960
I said I'm not free!

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.390
And what about your gear?!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.310
It won't hurt to leave my 
gear at school for a day.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.310
Okay! Let's go, Satoru!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.300
Where are we going?

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:06.210
To have fun!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.910
Wait, Senpai!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.480
Look at this, Satoru!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.950
What do you think?

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.370
So close!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.310
Makocchi, open wide!

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.550
Ikegami-san, that's bad manners.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.860
What? But it's so much more comfortable.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:47.100
Oh, I heard that Saki-chan is working.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.660
Yep, Saki-chi is saving 
up money so she can go

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.480
to school to work in daycare.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:53.740
Oh, my...

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:56.250
Daycare? That's perfect for her!

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.640
Wow, Saki-chan's taking 
control of her life.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.100
Planning for the future, huh...

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.760
Do you know what you 
want to do, Yumi-chan?

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:07.810
I'm okay with any job that 
lets me touch animals.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:11.350
So I've been thinking 
about becoming a groomer.

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.500
I see...

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.460
Funabashi-san, are you...

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.500
I'm going to college.

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.180
I'll probably choose 
an all-girls' school.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.580
Oh...

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.260
Saeki will be taking 
over the shrine, right?

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.140
And Ashihara will work 
at her family's inn.

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:26.980
What? I'm not going 
to take over the inn.

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:28.930
My big brother's got 
that taken care of.

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.240
Oh, really?

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:36.630
I love to eat, so I'm thinking about 
becoming a chef or nutritionist.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:41.000
That's great. You know 
what you want to do.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.230
Don't you know what you want to do?

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:43.830
Huh?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:48.980
I know that I want to protect our home,

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:51.730
but I'm not sure what 
exactly that means.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.320
Why don't you work as 
a shrine maiden then?

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:57.650
That's what I wanted to 
do when I was little,

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.560
but our shrine isn't big enough 
for a full-time shrine maiden.

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.560
Then you can become a bride.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.340
What?!

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:09.770
Except that Yumippe will probably 
be the first one to get married.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.810
What? No way!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.370
That'll make me a housewife.

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:15.080
I'll be so busy taking 
care of my husband

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.880
and kids that I'll be 
old before I know it!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:19.990
I don't wanna think about it!

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.980
That's a biased view, Ikegami-san.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.410
Are you sure about that?

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.600
Anyway, this topic scares 
me, so can we move on?

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.700
Let's.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.590
Ooh, look at this!

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:33.500
They're offering a 
limited time parfait!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.580
It's so big.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.160
Should I try it?

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.070
You'll upset your stomach again.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.380
It'll be okay!

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.260
<i>Wow, everyone's been</i>

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.970
<i>thinking about what they 
want to do in the future.</i>

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.550
<i>What do I want to do?</i>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.940
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.860
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:06.410
<b>Homemade
Tofu</b>

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:06.410
<b>Homemade Tofu Kinu-chan</b>

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.270
I'm home!

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.920
Welcome home, Taisuke.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.570
Oh, is this your friend?

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:10.100
He's a new club member.

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.040
Good evening.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.980
Oh, this is unusual.

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.390
It's been a while since the 
last time Sei-chan was here.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.630
Yeah, he's been busy.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.670
<b>Homemade Tofu 
Kinu-chan</b>

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.670
<i>He really lives in a tofu shop.</i>

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.520
Nii-chan!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.840
Welcome home!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.990
I'm back!

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:25.800
Oh, you're home?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.610
I'm back, Dad.

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.970
U-Uh, I need to get going.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.690
Oh, we're about to have dinner.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.190
Why don't you join us?

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.440
Stay for dinner.

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:36.970
Yep.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:39.960
Stay for dinner!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.390
Stay for dinner!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.540
Right?

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.400
<i>What am I doing here?</i>

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:57.220
How is it?

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:58.620
Oh, it's good.

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.210
There's plenty more.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.310
He said it's good, Nii-chan!

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:06.900
Silly, that crap doesn't taste good.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.210
You should eat this instead.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.600
Sorry, that's the tofu I made.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.520
Nii-chan always screws up.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.030
He practices every day and 
he still hasn't improved.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:26.040
That's harsh.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.120
I'm doing the best I can!

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:31.790
Man, stop making fun of your brother!

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.490
Look, Nii-chan! A cat!

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.590
Don't get too close to the river!

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.080
Cat!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:46.850
Uh...

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.220
This is far enough.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.730
Sorry about dragging you 
around with me today.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.650
It's okay. Though, it was annoying.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.650
Thought you might say that.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.320
Was this some kind of punishment?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.000
Huh?

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.850
Because I was making trouble.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:06.360
What? I just wanted to hang out.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.460
You don't like arcades?

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.580
I don't.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:13.420
Ditto.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.000
But I don't mind dropping 
by occasionally.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.210
What about

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.630
kendo?

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:29.360
Does it look like I hate kendo?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:30.580
No.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.560
It looks like you love it a lot.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.870
You have more blisters 
than everyone else,

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:39.140
and you use older gear that's 
been well maintained.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.290
I'd be shocked if you told 
me that you hated kendo.

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:46.240
Most of the time, you look like 
you don't care about anything,

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.580
but when it comes to kendo, 
you get upset about every little thing.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.870
And, when faced with a bigger opponent,

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.000
you aim for the face 
instead of backing down.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:59.640
It's more fun to battle it out with 
kendo instead of in an arcade.

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:04.010
If you give up now, 
you won't have as much fun.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:08.340
But kendo isn't my top priority.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:12.420
I care most about helping out at home.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.000
Eventually, I intend 
to become a priest.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:18.350
I've decided to quit 
kendo after high school.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.840
I still care about kendo.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.390
When you think about it,

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.730
you're just grinding 
soybeans into paste and

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.580
letting it sit when you make tofu.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:31.990
But if you make one mistake, 
it turns out all wrong.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.260
That's why I'm having trouble.

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:40.330
But nobody said that I have 
to quit kendo right now,

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.260
and I'm having fun doing both.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:44.570
Cat! Come here!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.730
You're able to do both right now.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.220
Why stop?

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:55.720
I used kendo to achieve my main goal,

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.480
so I think I'm done.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.850
Why does that matter?

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:09.450
Kendo can come second while you 
focus on your top priority.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.450
You're free to do everything you love.

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.650
Be greedy!

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:18.840
Kendo can come second...

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.710
<i>I see.</i>

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.620
Nii-chan!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.230
You're gonna get it now!

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:46.860
Uh, I'm sorry about acting 
like a brat today.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.680
Oh? What's this?

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:51.690
And thank you for this.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.000
That'll be your excuse.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.910
Make sure you use it 
correctly, you bad boy.

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.370
Whose fault is it that 
I'm out this late?

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.970
Drop by again and I'll let you try 
some tofu that I haven't screwed up.

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:04.660
I can't wait.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:10.300
Satoru isn't home yet!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.510
It's already nine!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.350
Satoru! Where are you, Satoru?!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:15.570
Calm down, Haru-chan.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.690
Oh, he's back!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:21.770
Satoru!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.420
Is Satoru-kun back?

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.820
You were out rather late.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:36.290
Uh, I was hanging out with 
someone from the kendo club.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.860
I should have called...

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.250
That's not good enough.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.280
You made everyone worry.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:47.980
What should you say?

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:50.710
Uh...

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.920
I-I'm sorry.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:56.380
Good.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.350
Next time, call and let us know 
if you're going to be late.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:02.550
Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:04.290
Why are you so quiet?

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.080
I'm done.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.320
It's not my job to say anything.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:13.030
What?! Tofu from Kinu-chan?!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.510
They gave me some to bring home.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:17.960
Oh, their tofu is really good!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.740
Is the store that famous?

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:24.880
Sorry about today, Haru.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.670
I wasn't worried about you.

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.270
It's been a long day...

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.060
Satoru?

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:40.140
Satoru-kun, are you 
going to take a bath?

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.590
Satoru-kun?

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.180
Huh? Haru-chan?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.870
Oh. 'Sup, Captain?

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:02.990
<i>Kamio!</i>

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.910
Come on, guys.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.200
Hey!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:10.900
Just you wait.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:15.770
While you're skipping practice, 
I'll become strong enough to beat you,

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:18.090
so you better not quit!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.460
If you say so.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.010
Assuming you actually get stronger...

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:26.680
You really piss me off!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.140
That hurts!

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:32.220
Hey, Taisuke!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.860
Oh, Seishiro.

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:36.440
What are you doing here?

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:40.340
How dare you ignore my presence?

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:44.040
D-Don't tell me that you're...

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:46.370
Kamio Satoru?!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.060
I hear that the girls have 
nicknamed you Prince.

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:54.270
No matter.

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.320
Because I am King!

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.610
Oh, this is the student 
council president.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:03.580
Have you seen him around?

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.520
He's got good grades, but he's stupid.

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:09.220
That's why I'm his only friend.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.180
Hold on!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.140
When did you and I become friends?!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:15.430
It's just that we've been 
schoolmates since grade school!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:16.360
Yeah, yeah.

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:18.940
My mom said to invite you over.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.330
Every time I go, I have to 
eat the tofu you screwed up!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:23.880
Oh, Satoru.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.370
Are you missing practice Friday 
and Saturday next week because

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.770
something's happening at the shrine?

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.230
The summer purification ceremony.

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:30.080
Summer?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.500
There are large festivals 
twice a year to cleanse off

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.810
everything that's accumulated 
the past six months.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.750
If you're interested...

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:41.800
Oh, you have practice.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:43.900
Wait, hold on.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:47.600
I think this event is very 
relevant for the kendo club.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.480
We have a better chance of 
winning after being cleansed.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:52.570
Are you a believer?

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.120
Wait!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:57.170
Is that the event that Hiwako 
said she would be attending?!

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.020
Hi—  Yeah...

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:02.230
W-Will Hiwako dress up 
like a shrine maiden?!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.590
Probably.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.850
Wait, but it's a shrine...

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.160
A shrine...

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.540
When we were in grade 
school, we were chased

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:17.760
around a shrine by a bird 
monster wearing a kimono.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:18.980
Stop!

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:21.150
He was traumatized by the experience.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:22.670
Don't talk about it!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:25.510
We were just kids.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.030
There aren't any monsters.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:29.100
I-I'm not scared!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.680
I just don't like talking 
about stuff that isn't real!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:34.010
<i>A bird monster?</i>

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.550
<i>Was that a herald?</i>

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.110
D-Did you just laugh at me?!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:43.680
No, I believe your story,

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.570
since I can see spirits.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.780
Goodbye.

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:51.400
He laughed at me!

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:52.750
It's your fault!

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.870
Why don't you say something?!

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.930
You're ruining my image!

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:59.510
Hey! Are you listening?!

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:22.360
Did something good happen, Satoru?

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:25.380
Probably. He's practicing harder now.

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:27.950
What would you know?!

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:29.030
What?

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:33.570
No, nothing happened.

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:19.850
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:19.850
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:14.130
Hello, this is Satoru.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.560
The summer purification 
takes place in June,

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:19.190
while the New Year purification 
takes place in December.

00:24:19.890 --> 00:24:22.160
Next time: "Makoto's Future."

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:26.000
<b>Makoto's Future</b>

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:24.700
May fortune be with you, hopefully.
